<title>UK: Queens Moat makes H1 pretax, pre-except loss.</title>
<headline>Queens Moat makes H1 pretax, pre-except loss.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		0.4 loss	     vs 20.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 nil		    vs nil</p>
<p> Pretax		     3.1 loss	     vs 0.7 profit</p>
<p> Turnover		   222.8		  vs 224.1</p>
<p> Operating profit	 23.2		   vs 18.4</p>
<p> Exceptional profit     1.4		    vs 25.7</p>
<p> Interest payable	 27.7		   vs 19.4</p>
<p>NOTE - UK hotels group Queens Moat Houses Plc said it expected to make satisfactory progress in the second half. The company said its disposals strategy was on course and it was currently in discussions with &quot;a number of parties&quot; in connection with the disposal of 27 hotels.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
